WEBVTT

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:06.050
Tell me...

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:12.540
I was abandoned when I was born and
hated for my strange powers...

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:16.820
Hurting others... I'm completely unwanted,
without a place anywhere!

00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:21.300
Why was I even born?

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:28.270
Why? I'm not...

00:00:28.980 --> 00:00:30.650
I'm here.

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:33.620
Come with me.

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:38.220
I will not betray you.

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:54.720
Only I know your pain...

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:57.220
Your uncertainty...

00:00:57.860 --> 00:01:00.140
Your loneliness...

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:05.240
If only we could be together forever.

00:01:06.860 --> 00:01:11.740
I'll say it as many times as you wish.

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:21.960
I will not betray you!

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:11.200
We must return.

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:13.380
What?

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:15.670
We must return.

00:03:16.290 --> 00:03:18.950
Return where?

00:03:20.060 --> 00:03:22.820
He's waiting for us.

00:03:24.780 --> 00:03:26.170
Who is?

00:03:26.900 --> 00:03:28.610
Who's waiting?

00:03:30.630 --> 00:03:35.440
He is. Our most beloved...

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:47.110
Huh?

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:51.640
Where am I...

00:04:00.270 --> 00:04:03.900
What's wrong? Have a nightmare?

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:11.240
It's all right.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:15.290
I will stay by your side.

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:32.340
A New Encounter

00:04:32.740 --> 00:04:34.600
What's wrong, Yuki-chan?

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:35.620
Are you okay?

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:42.400
Oh, s-sorry. I just had a weird dream.

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:46.980
It didn't feel like a dream, though...

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:51.700
That figures.
Everything happened only yesterday.

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:55.740
Luka probably just didn't have anything
to do while you were asleep.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:05:00.000
Looks like he's sleeping well.

00:05:04.390 --> 00:05:05.670
Toko-chan,

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:07.050
is something wrong?

00:05:08.230 --> 00:05:10.940
I've just never seen Luka asleep.

00:05:10.940 --> 00:05:11.760
Huh?

00:05:11.980 --> 00:05:15.600
He's never slept in front of us before.

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:17.850
Really?

00:05:18.160 --> 00:05:21.810
He must be relieved,
having you by his side.

00:05:24.250 --> 00:05:26.520
Toko-chan, you have me.

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:28.860
Wh-What are you talking about?

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:30.780
You know you can't lie to me.

00:05:30.780 --> 00:05:34.160
You idiot! That's not it!

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:36.110
They get along so well.

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:37.990
Oh, right!

00:05:37.990 --> 00:05:41.590
I don't think I could heal Luka's injury.

00:05:41.590 --> 00:05:43.810
I wouldn't be so quick to say that.

00:05:44.260 --> 00:05:45.410
Why?

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:49.630
Earlier, when I asked him
to let me heal him...

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:55.090
I'm fine.

00:05:56.260 --> 00:05:59.390
I think he said that for your sake.

00:05:59.820 --> 00:06:01.060
For my sake?

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:05.910
He didn't want you to endure the pain
of using God's Light to heal.

00:06:05.910 --> 00:06:08.980
Luka's really kind.

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:18.860
Did I say something weird?

00:06:18.860 --> 00:06:24.370
Luka's only nice to you, Yuki-chan.

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:26.870
He treats us completely differently.

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:31.420
Why is he only nice to me?

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:35.430
Don't worry.

00:06:35.430 --> 00:06:37.600
Luka will explain it to you eventually.

00:06:39.220 --> 00:06:40.350
Okay.

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:48.810
Luka's always there to protect me,
and I feel safe at his side.

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:53.530
But I don't know anything about him.

00:06:54.060 --> 00:06:57.740
Today's the day he's coming, right?

00:06:57.740 --> 00:07:00.740
Yes. He should be here soon.

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:03.750
An unknown...

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:07.430
How mysterious.

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:20.010
Those are the case files from the homicide
that's stumped the nation, right?

00:07:20.220 --> 00:07:25.770
Yeah. This will be your first
time meeting them, right?

00:07:26.370 --> 00:07:27.390
Them?

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:31.330
The Giou Clan.

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:37.090
Only select members of the police
know about them.

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:39.920
The Giou Clan?

00:07:40.610 --> 00:07:43.100
Who are they?

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:47.590
Some cases can't be solved,
no matter how much evidence

00:07:47.590 --> 00:07:50.080
or how many witnesses you have.

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:52.800
Usually, an unknown is involved in those.

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:55.170
Unknown?

00:07:56.100 --> 00:08:00.180
Unidentified entities,
more generally known as demons.

00:08:01.290 --> 00:08:03.430
A-Are you serious?

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:07.570
Of course. I hate to admit it,

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:09.520
but the police can't do anything
about demons.

00:08:10.340 --> 00:08:20.660
That's why we send those cases to the
Giou Clan, the experts in this field.

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:30.950
Why not rest a little bit?

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:33.170
We still have a ways to go.

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:36.050
I feel wide awake, though.

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:39.570
You need to rest whenever
you can, Yuki-chan.

00:08:40.710 --> 00:08:41.930
Toko-chan...

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:43.670
Remember what I said?

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:48.040
Every time you use your ability,
you'll experience pain.

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:55.520
If we run out of power in a battle,
we'll rely on you for our strength, Yuki.

00:08:56.270 --> 00:09:00.390
We can't fight without relying
on your power.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:05.910
I know. I'm certain I felt it.

00:09:13.020 --> 00:09:15.360
I know what I can do.

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:17.870
I know what I must do.

00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:22.180
To put it bluntly,

00:09:22.590 --> 00:09:24.930
we need you.

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:31.340
That's why the Duras hunt you.

00:09:35.640 --> 00:09:38.470
This is your destiny.

00:09:48.550 --> 00:09:50.400
Destined to fight...

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.880
I cannot avoid my fate.

00:09:57.750 --> 00:09:59.150
I'm here.

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:09.590
Don't look so sad.

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:14.770
This means I have a role, doesn't it?

00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:21.530
I'm just happy I can help someone
with my powers. I'll do my best.

00:10:21.970 --> 00:10:25.780
So don't worry about it.

00:10:26.990 --> 00:10:29.090
I'm glad we got to meet again.

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:29.990
Again?

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:33.420
You said we'd see each other again
after we met the first time.

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:36.460
Oh... You don't remember, do you?

00:10:36.770 --> 00:10:41.460
We've been fighting Duras together
since our previous lives.

00:10:42.710 --> 00:10:43.890
Previous lives?

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:44.430
Yeah.

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:48.770
Zweilt Guardians always work as a pair,
like me and Tsukumo, and-

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:50.140
Uh...

00:10:50.450 --> 00:10:52.310
What are Zweilt Guardians?

00:10:52.830 --> 00:11:00.570
I guess you could say, Zweilt Guardians are
warriors that partner up to fight Duras.

00:11:01.070 --> 00:11:04.280
Zweilt Guardians live together
in the Twilight Mansion.

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:08.030
We're on our way to the Twilight
Mansion, aren't we?

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:09.380
Yeah.

00:11:09.380 --> 00:11:11.850
There are probably a few pairs
that aren't back yet,

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:13.710
but everyone's looking forward
to seeing you.

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:15.390
What are they like?

00:11:15.390 --> 00:11:18.960
I'm sorry, but the Twilight Mansion
will have to wait.

00:11:20.180 --> 00:11:24.540
Takashiro-sama has instructed me to
stop at the police department first.

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:27.560
Yuki-kun and Luka-kun will get out there.

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:29.860
The police department?

00:11:30.490 --> 00:11:34.180
Then I guess you'll be meeting
Hotsuma and Shusei first.

00:11:34.180 --> 00:11:36.940
Hotsuma and Shusei?

00:11:37.300 --> 00:11:39.660
They're Zweilt Guardians, just like us.

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:41.400
They're your new friends.

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:45.190
New friends...

00:12:02.160 --> 00:12:06.610
Seems like we've had to run
a lot of errands lately.

00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:10.470
It's just a sign of how active
the Duras have become.

00:12:10.900 --> 00:12:14.670
You could have stayed home, Hotsuma.

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:16.730
Don't be ridiculous.

00:12:17.180 --> 00:12:24.150
If you were attacked by a Duras,
what could you do alone?

00:12:26.080 --> 00:12:27.940
You worry too much.

00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:29.540
Don't dodge the question!

00:12:30.990 --> 00:12:35.450
Yuki should be arriving today.

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:39.580
What do I care? That's got
nothing to do with me.

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:45.140
Really? Then I suppose it has
nothing to do with me, either.

00:12:53.400 --> 00:12:57.890
Should we really give this
kid such important files?

00:12:59.930 --> 00:13:04.840
This kid can see the culprit
in his crystal ball.

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:12.110
Demon slaying and crystal balls?
Talk about the paranormal...

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:14.300
Set a thief to catch a thief.

00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:17.710
We send monsters to take care of monsters.

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:23.040
Concerned?

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:26.800
Yuki should be here soon.

00:13:27.550 --> 00:13:29.440
I don't care.

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:31.860
I don't need him.

00:13:33.690 --> 00:13:37.220
So, then you still hate Yuki?

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:41.170
Give him a proper welcome
when you see him.

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:15.580
Be careful, Yuki-chan.

00:14:15.580 --> 00:14:16.850
Of what?

00:14:16.850 --> 00:14:21.730
Hotsuma's an unfriendly hothead,
with a dirty mouth.

00:14:21.730 --> 00:14:23.280
He's a problem child!

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:24.310
Really?

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:27.890
But he's good at what he does.

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:30.440
Yuki, see you later.

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:32.460
Sure.

00:14:32.460 --> 00:14:33.900
See you later.

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:40.330
I hope Yuki-chan will be okay. I wish he could
have taken it easy on his first day.

00:14:41.000 --> 00:14:42.200
Yeah.

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:50.100
Suddenly taken to a new place, told all kinds
of stories, and forced to meet strangers...

00:14:51.470 --> 00:14:54.550
I feel bad for him.

00:14:55.650 --> 00:14:58.760
Don't worry. Luka's with him.

00:14:58.760 --> 00:15:02.320
Yeah. You're right.

00:15:14.820 --> 00:15:15.820
Is something wrong?

00:15:15.820 --> 00:15:23.960
No... I just thought I'd call a friend back home,
but I can't reach him.

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:31.220
I wish I could have exchanged a proper
farewell with Kanata-san.

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:36.850
Sorry to make you come all this way, Yuki.

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:38.340
Takashiro-san.

00:15:38.610 --> 00:15:43.640
This is my last chance to see you before
I become too busy with work again.

00:15:43.640 --> 00:15:45.100
You must be tired.

00:15:46.180 --> 00:15:48.520
I-I'm fine.

00:15:49.450 --> 00:15:54.650
We've taken care of most
everything you'll need while here,

00:15:54.650 --> 00:15:57.030
so don't worry about school.

00:15:57.460 --> 00:16:02.140
I've also registered you as
my younger brother.

00:16:02.140 --> 00:16:06.120
You're a member of the Giou Clan now. Got it?

00:16:06.120 --> 00:16:07.960
All right.

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:12.700
Zess, I need to talk to you.

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:14.420
Could you come with me?

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:17.300
Yuki, we'll just be a minute.

00:16:18.470 --> 00:16:19.390
Sure.

00:16:21.810 --> 00:16:26.230
Zess... Or can I call you Luka now?

00:16:26.720 --> 00:16:29.670
Make it quick. What do you want?

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:32.170
Are you interested in Yuki?

00:16:33.460 --> 00:16:39.990
I thought I'd ask how you felt about Yuki,
but maybe I don't need to.

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:48.030
You don't seem to have changed your mind
about working with us.

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:53.040
Of course not.

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:59.760
That is Yuki.
I know they have the same soul.

00:17:00.860 --> 00:17:02.550
My feelings have not changed.

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:05.220
I will protect Yuki.

00:17:05.550 --> 00:17:08.770
That is my top priority.

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:17.240
I'm relieved to hear you say that.

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:20.360
To be honest, I was counting
on your power.

00:17:20.360 --> 00:17:25.830
Just so you know, I don't intend to go along
with your plans. I don't trust you.

00:17:25.830 --> 00:17:32.460
That's fine. Keep up the
distrustful attitude.

00:17:32.930 --> 00:17:35.940
It will protect Yuki.

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:06.470
What's wrong?

00:18:09.180 --> 00:18:12.250
Where are your mother and father?
Aren't they with you?

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:17.710
I tripped and ruined my clothes.

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:21.260
If I go back, they'll be mad at me...

00:18:23.360 --> 00:18:28.290
It's okay. Clothes can be replaced.

00:18:28.690 --> 00:18:32.290
Your safety is much more important.

00:18:38.380 --> 00:18:40.520
There you go.

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:44.910
Thank you.

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:52.660
Looks like you got really dirty.

00:19:00.720 --> 00:19:01.920
What's wrong?

00:19:08.640 --> 00:19:09.350
Yuki!

00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:13.230
Burn, dark one.

00:19:21.030 --> 00:19:24.690
Hey, you. You're Giou Yuki, right?

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:29.490
You...

00:19:32.650 --> 00:19:35.470
Could he be...

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:41.700
What are you? Stupid?

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:44.090
What are you doing out here alone?

00:19:44.710 --> 00:19:47.840
Don't you know the Duras are after you?

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:51.760
It is him!

00:19:52.110 --> 00:19:56.060
How do they expect me to
look after such an idiot?

00:19:56.780 --> 00:20:00.860
<i>An unfriendly hothead with a dirty mouth.
He's a problem child!</i>

00:20:01.190 --> 00:20:03.420
You're Hotsuma-kun, aren't you?

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:08.860
Nice to meet you. I'm...

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:11.240
Don't touch me.

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:15.830
I'm not here to make friends with you.

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:21.070
Great... Here he comes.

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:23.710
Luka.

00:20:24.280 --> 00:20:28.220
Pretty slow for a watchdog, aren't you?

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:30.680
Got a problem?

00:20:31.570 --> 00:20:36.590
Why don't you keep your
precious princess on a leash?

00:20:38.180 --> 00:20:39.480
It's okay.

00:20:40.810 --> 00:20:42.440
You must have had quite a scare.

00:20:42.660 --> 00:20:45.070
Everything's okay now. Don't worry.

00:20:47.780 --> 00:20:50.860
Stop always worrying about everyone else!

00:21:02.240 --> 00:21:03.410
Are you okay?

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:07.350
I'm sorry for coming out here
without telling you.

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:09.320
I'm glad you're all right.

00:21:09.320 --> 00:21:12.260
Hotsuma-kun saved me.

00:21:14.570 --> 00:21:16.720
Did he say anything to you?

00:21:16.720 --> 00:21:22.950
No. He just looked very sad.

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:34.470
Did you see Yuki?

00:21:35.110 --> 00:21:36.330
Whatever.

00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:40.790
I only need you.

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:48.810
Hotsuma...

00:21:50.170 --> 00:21:58.370
You haven't realized kindness can
hurt others, have you?

00:23:36.260 --> 00:23:39.850
Hotsuma, I heard you fought
with Toko again.

00:23:40.490 --> 00:23:43.700
She said Tsukumo is cooler than you!

00:23:43.700 --> 00:23:46.020
Something about his legs being
two centimeters longer...

00:23:46.020 --> 00:23:46.460
The Boundary between
Light and Despair

00:23:46.460 --> 00:23:50.170
Hey, think you can stop the petty fighting?
